你點讚～）但得到的回覆是主廚說這是正常的味道\n當下家人無法接受此說法 直接把麵還他了（吃過覺得不對才端著去問的）因此我也沒拍到麵的照片\n以上 大家自行斟酌😌",null,[0,41]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/11510591223002326412/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBuTUdSVlNqUk1Wa3BUVFZaT2JsRnFRbk5PVm1SNFlsWk9VVlJYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11510591223002326412/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBuTUdSVlNqUk1Wa3BUVFZaT2JsRnFRbk5PVm1SNFlsWk9VVlJYWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/11510591223002326412/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBuTUdSVlNqUk1Wa3BUVFZaT2JsRnFRbk5PVm1SNFlsWk9VVlJYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11510591223002326412/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBuTUdSVlNqUk1Wa3BUVFZaT2JsRnFRbk5PVm1SNFlsWk9VVlJYWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/11510591223002326412/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBuTUdSVlNqUk1Wa3BUVFZaT2JsRnFRbk5PVm1SNFlsWk9VVlJYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11510591223002326412/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBuTUdSVlNqUk1Wa3BUVFZaT2JsRnFRbk5PVm1SNFlsWk9VVlJYWXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,2872,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pnMGRVSjRMVkpTTVZOblFqQnNOVmR4YlZOUVRXYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x2b4ae40a35a399a9!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjg0dUJ4LVJSMVNnQjBsNVdxbVNQTWc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pnMGRVSjRMVkpTTVZOblFqQnNOVmR4YlZOUVRXYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pnMGRVSjRMVkpTTVZOblFqQnNOVmR4YlZOUVRXYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pnMGRVSjRMVkpTTVZOblFqQnNOVmR4YlZOUVRXYxILMGRMdGNvVmhnS0EaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09qZzBkVUo0TFZKU01WTm5RakJzTlZkeGJWTlFUV2MSCzBkTHRjb1ZoZ0tBIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARqZmjNQrkSisqCzBkTHRjb1ZoZ0tB\u0026wv\u003d1\u00